{"SystemName":"ShipmentDelivered.CustomerNotification","Title":"{{Store.Name}} sipari\u015Finiz teslim edildi","Content":"\u003Cdiv style=\u0022font-family: Arial, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, Helvetica, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius: 5px; background-color: #ffffff;\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv style=\u0022text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\u0022\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022{{Store.URL}}\u0022 style=\u0022text-decoration: none; color: #333;\u0022\u003E\u003Ch1 style=\u0022color: #4a6ee0; margin: 0;\u0022\u003E{{Store.Name}}\u003C/h1\u003E\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv style=\u0022padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 5px; margin-bottom: 20px;\u0022\u003E\u003Ch2 style=\u0022color: #333; margin-top: 0;\u0022\u003EMerhaba {{Order.CustomerFullName}},\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #333;\u0022\u003E\u0130yi haberlerimiz var! Sipari\u015Finiz ba\u015Far\u0131yla teslim edildi.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #333;\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESipari\u015F Numaras\u0131:\u003C/strong\u003E {{Order.OrderNumber}}\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESipari\u015F Detaylar\u0131:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ca href=\u0022{{Order.OrderURLForCustomer}}\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 style=\u0022color: #4a6ee0; text-decoration: none;\u0022\u003ESipari\u015Finizi g\u00F6r\u00FCnt\u00FClemek i\u00E7in t\u0131klay\u0131n\u003C/a\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESipari\u015F Tarihi:\u003C/strong\u003E {{Order.CreatedOn}}\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv style=\u0022display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv style=\u0022width: 48%; padding: 15px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 5px; margin-bottom: 10px;\u0022\u003E\u003Ch3 style=\u0022margin-top: 0; color: #333; border-bottom: 1px solid #e6e6e6; padding-bottom: 8px;\u0022\u003EFatura